Stop reprinting Importing: 100% during an import

inflateInterrupter divides by a hard-coded per-arch expectedTotalAccess
estimate. Once the real access count passes it the ratio is pinned at 1.0,
and the throttle's percent == 100 test fires on every step, printing a few
thousand identical lines. Requiring lastPrintedPercent < 100 keeps the final
100% line and caps an import at 21 lines.
